# What the docs home page shows: its content as an accessibility tree, and a picture of it.
# Run by `mise run journeys:compare`, which compares the two sites; the result is not a verified file.
# @tags compare
# @requires build-type:assembler compare
set viewport 1280 800
open ./
wait --load networkidle
get title
snapshot -c -s "#main-container"
screenshot "#main-container" home.png
